        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur FLPBED, Beaded Pocket Door Flush Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis decorative oval shaped beaded flush pull is great for pocket doors, sliding doors, cabinet doors, any door where a flush with the door face pull is needed. Add a bit of style to your home with this decorative design flush pull. This solid brass Decorative Beaded Pocket Door Flush Pull offers both fashion and function. With its beaded design and oval shape, it's a beautiful yet classic piece for your home. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOver the years, Grandeur products have amassed a nationwide following of clients. Customers include thousands of antique dealers, restoration contractors, homeowners, builders, architects and others, just like you. The Grandeur line is also a favorite among Hollywood art directors. The company's decorative products have been used in over 150 films and television programs.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur Nostalgic Warehouse Collection</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Decorative Beaded Pocket Door Flush Pull: \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Height: 6-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Width:  2-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth:  1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth:  5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Height:  3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Width:  1-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged complete with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
